SUMMARY:Throwing Tall
DESCRIPTION:Elevate your throwing skills in this one-day workshop and learn to throw tall! The goal of the workshop is to help your throwing practice and build confidence in throwing taller pieces with speed and accuracy. No prior experience needed! Students will leave the workshop with a stronger understanding of:\nTechniques for throwing taller forms\nMaintaining even wall thickness\nHow to keep clay cylinder narrow\nMastering speed and pressure\n…and more based on the needs and interests of the class!\nAGES 15+\nPrice: $45\nTime: 6:00-8:30 pm\nWorkshop date:\nTuesday\, May 26
